1
00:00:00,136 --> 00:00:03,556
(Sheldon:)So what?
I don't issue invitations to your mother.

2
00:00:04,015 --> 00:00:06,895
(Missy:)It would be nice not to have to drive
to Anaheim in rush hour.

3
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:09,100
(Sheldon:)And don't ever call me Shelly.

4
00:00:09,271 --> 00:00:11,521
(Leonard:)So it's settled. You'll stay with us.

5
00:00:11,690 --> 00:00:15,150
(Howard:)I'll walk you to your car.
You're in Structure 3, Level C, right?

6
00:00:18,905 --> 00:00:21,245
(Sheldon:)What just happened?

7
00:00:22,742 --> 00:00:24,372
So anyway, we're 8 years old...

8
00:00:24,536 --> 00:00:28,916
(Missy:)...and Sheldon converts my Easy-Bake Oven
to some kind of high-powered furnace.

9
00:00:29,082 --> 00:00:31,922
That's just classic.

10
00:00:32,335 --> 00:00:35,125
(Sheldon:)I needed a place to fire
ceramic semiconductor substrates...

11
00:00:35,297 --> 00:00:37,337
(Sheldon:)...for homemade integrated circuits.

12
00:00:37,507 --> 00:00:41,217
He was trying to build some sort of
armed robot to keep me out of his room.

13
00:00:41,386 --> 00:00:45,056
(Sheldon:)Made necessary by her insistence
on going into my room.

14
00:00:45,223 --> 00:00:48,513
Anyway, I make those little muffins
they give you. There's a big flash.

15
00:00:48,685 --> 00:00:51,355
(Missy:)Next thing you know,
my eyebrows are gone.

16
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:55,020
(Howard:)Not your eyebrows?

17
00:00:55,191 --> 00:00:57,531
(Missy:)Yep, I had to go through
the entire second grade...

18
00:00:57,694 --> 00:01:00,284
(Missy:)...with crooked eyebrows
my mom drew on.

